            "dot_inactive_color": "#ffffff",
            "testimonial_1": "The order arrived safely and more than exceeded my expectations. The crystal is truly exquisite! In addition to the glasses I must say that the customer service was superb; we will undoubtedly be purchasing many more items from you in the future.",
            "author_1": "Hayley",
            "location_1": "Canada",
            "testimonial_2": "I received my ARTĚL order, and want to send you a big THANK YOU!!!\nThe items are beautiful, true works of art.\nI greatly appreciate your customer care and service. Your kindness and patience added to the very positive experience of discovering the artistry of ARTĚL, selecting items, and making a purchase.",
            "author_2": "Carol",
            "location_2": "Iowa",
            "testimonial_3": "I am writing to say thank you for the outstanding, attentive, and exceptional customer service I received throughout the entire ordering process from everyone at ARTĚL. This quality of service matches perfectly with the masterpieces from your house and is a rarity, especially in times of \"fast online shopping”. It is really a pleasure to be an ARTĚL customer!",
            "author_3": "Peter",
            "location_3": "Austria",
            "testimonial_4": "Thank you for your excellent service and craftsmanship.\nThe tumblers were beautifully packed and arrived exactly when expected.",
            "author_4": "Susan",
            "location_4": "California",
            "testimonial_5": "Your customer service is amazing. The pieces are gorgeous. I will definitely order from you again!",
            "author_5": "Mara",
            "location_5": "Pennsylvania",
            "testimonial_6": "My order arrived safely and is stunning! I am 100% satisfied and love the glass! The craftsmanship\nis supurb!",
            "author_6": "Brian",
            "location_6": "Florida",
            "testimonial_7": "The glasses look amazing and are real works of art. The attention to detail on them is extraordinary. I would also like to thank you for your exceptional customer service! It was very helpful to receive the updates on the order and experience your professionalism and your care. It has been an absolute pleasure working with ARTĚL",
            "author_7": "Nataliya",
            "location_7": "Ukraine",
            "testimonial_8": "It's an ARTEL Christmas this year! Thank you again for your assistance with our order, all items arrived safely! Everything is beautiful and I'm excited to build my glassware collection. Our trip to Prague and our visit to the ARTEL store were our 2024 highlights. Wishing you a Merry Christmas and happy holidays!",
            "author_8": "Jennifer",
            "location_8": "Oklahoma",
            "testimonial_9": "The perfect gift, just as I had hoped it would be. Thanks so much to the entire staff for their exceptional professionalism, their amazing design, their exquisite production, and their perfectly wrapped and timely shipment of this beautiful piece",
            "author_9": "Mike",
            "location_9": "Virginia",
            "testimonial_10": "The glasses arrived safe and sound and I LOVE them! The color is SO beautiful and I love the design I chose! So pleased with the whole process...great customer service and great product, thank you.",
            "author_10": "Julia",
            "location_10": "Wisconsin",
            "testimonial_11": "The glasses have arrived, safe and sound and they are beautiful. The customer service that I have received has been fantastic. I appreciate both your products and your customer service.",
            "author_11": "David",
            "location_11": "Texas",
            "testimonial_12": "They are just beautiful! I wish I had bought more! We will enjoy them every day for many years to come. Please thank everyone involved for the wonderful design, exceptional workmanship, the packing of the box....everything was just perfect.",
            "author_12": "Marla",
            "location_12": "Spain",
            "testimonial_13": "Thank you for your kind, courteous, prompt and friendly service. I appreciate it very much - it makes a big difference!",
            "author_13": "Susan",
            "location_13": "Massachusetts",
            "testimonial_14": "I LOVE them! Makes any drink super special.\nYour company is outstanding in its service and care.",
            "author_14": "Louise",
            "location_14": "Texas",
            "testimonial_15": "The glasses are ABSOLUTELY Exquisite!\nThank you.",
            "author_15": "Ann",
            "location_15": "Massachusetts"
